id = &"scrap_sorting"
title = "Scrap Sorting"
description = "THE BEAT: the first time the yard runs dry mid-build, usually inside the first ten minutes. It is the cheapest node in the tree and it pays back within the hour. It exists so that a player who is losing always has something to do that is not waiting."
flavour = "Sort before you smelt. Half of what you were burning was already iron."
